WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.090
We got Super Cyalume Coords!

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:04.320
<i>What</i>?

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.520
But why?

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:06.530
Why was I the only one not to get any?
But why?

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:10.990
Why was I the only one not to get any?

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:24.050
Reona, why'd everyone get Super Cyalume Coords but me?

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.440
Dorothy, relax.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.740
Capisce!

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.460
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.260
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.420
Collect Divine Coords and become a Divine Idol!

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.900
One day, I discovered a mysterious baby in PriPara!

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.270
She started calling me "Mama"...

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.770
I can't believe this!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.160
Dorothy!

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.580
Are you okay?

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:28.370
Hey, they stopped!

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:30.450
Thank goodness.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.590
You can die if you hiccough a hundred times.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.160
Jululu!

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:43.100
Just whaddya got to complain about after I pledged heart and soul into taking care of you?

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:46.030
You pledged your heart and soul?

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:51.270
You bet I did! I used a whole half of my pocket money on baby cakes, you know?

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:57.160
I bought her expensive juice, taught her how to play cool games, lavished her with love and attention...

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.570
Ring any bells, goddess?

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:04.570
So you failed to brown-nose your way into those rare coords?

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:07.660
Man, I'm really steamed! I'm 100 degrees steaming mad!

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.530
Cuteness won't help you if you're a brat!

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:09.760
After all that delicious food, the little rugrat should be all like, "sure thing, Dorothy!"...
line 1
line 2

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:15.240
Don't be scared, Jululu. Dorothy sounds mean, but she's really nice.

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:17.260
She just wants to get closer to you!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:22.170
You kidding me? I couldn't care less!
I just want those Super Cyalume Coords!

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:26.270
Then why don't you take charge of Jululu one more time?

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:27.140
Why should I?

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:33.360
Friends knowing each other from infancy will perceive each others' true goodness, so it is said.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:38.440
I want her to get to know all your good points.

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.960
Seriously?

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:42.320
Yes! We're all your friends, Dorothy.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:42.920
Yep!

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.320
Jululu, can you give me a "Capisce"?

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:46.990
Ah-ee!

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.400
No way!

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.100
I sure as heck <i>don't</i> capisce!

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:55.670
Furry good. I like the sound of that.

00:03:56.010 --> 00:04:02.650
If Dorothy gets a Super Cyalume Coord, then Dressing Pafé can enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix...

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:07.440
Usacha's amazing big brother will 100% become the apple of her eye again!

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:11.240
Ha-ha-ha-hundred! I'm 200% sure that's not happening.

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:11.550
Usa!

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:13.920
You're 100% free to dream, though, I suppaws.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.200
So give it your 100% max, Dorothy!

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.520
Well, if it comes to this...

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.060
Take good care of Jululu.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.660
We'll come to retrieve her before the show.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:29.680
Jululu, take good care of Dorothy.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.660
Make sure you be good, Jululu.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:32.620
100-pri!

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:36.120
You're just gonna leave us alone together?

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.800
I know it's done now, but...

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.520
will they be fine together?

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:45.500
Spare the rod and spoil the child-pri.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:46.970
I'm sure they'll be fine.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.890
It's a good chance for Dorothy to grow up, too.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:52.560
Right!

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.080
Jeez...

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:58.830
Now I'm stuck looking after you again – what a pain in the neck.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.840
Na! Na!

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:28.380
Damn that Triangle!

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:33.060
There's no way the great Dressing Pafé could lose those newbies.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:37.480
All right, I get it. I'll take good proper care of you,

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:40.760
and get those Super Cyalume Coords once and for all.

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:46.570
That was the performance you can listen to a hundred thousand times,

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.160
by Divine Idol Grand Prix contestant Triangle!

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.380
Hey there, Jululu!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:57.710
Here's the sweet and sultry superwoman idol – Dorothy!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:58.440
Hey, baby.

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:06.350
And you're the first little baby this one-in-a-hundred, no, one-in-a-<i>million</i> idol's gonna play with!

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:08.630
You're number one! Aren't you lucky?

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:15.260
Here's a special 100,000-volt Max Ray for ya, baby!

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:22.330
Oi, kid. You don't yawn there; you get overjoyed. Read the mood a little, would ya?

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:26.600
Wait, do you maybe prefer abuse to getting praised?

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.040
Okay, got it.

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:33.990
Hold up! You can't just run off into the Rosette Pact...

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.410
What?

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.920
What's going on?

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:58.970
Are you freaking kidding me?

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:01.080
Hey, baby.

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:05.760
This is 100% hopeless.

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.560
When I look like this...

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:15.900
My legs are so short you can't tell when I lift them!

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.100
Argh...

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.810
My arm won't go over!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.530
I wasn't talking about you, Jululu!

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:27.850
Hey, don't give me that look.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:30.880
I was caught 100% unaware, too.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.110
Well, I guess this'll have to do.

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:37.200
I can play with you and get in your good books here.

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:39.600
Anyway, though...

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.560
I didn't realise what a cute place you lived in.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:48.510
When Reona and I were your age, we shared the <i>same</i> bed, you know.

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.100
It's pretty cool!

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:55.340
Hey, there's even another room!

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:58.650
There's a kitchen, too? This place is a palace!

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:01.690
Hey, wait, you cook even though you're a baby?

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:03.800
Heh, no way, right?

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:05.290
Oho!

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:09.930
That's it – it's for Jewlie!

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.470
She's gotta be in here somewhere!

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:18.360
For real? Then, that'd mean the Super Cyalume Coords were here too...

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:22.440
I can handle grabbing them here, even if the goddess doesn't want to hand them over.

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:25.070
Are they in the picture book?

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.790
The baby food?

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.370
The ball...?

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:33.120
A coupon sheet for a 100-yen shop...

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.490
This is all junk.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:43.550
So you like that, do you?

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:46.210
I guess you really are a baby.

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:53.180
Woo-hoo!

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:56.300
Hey, this is pretty fun!

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.990
Woo-hoo!

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:03.630
Oh, man!

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:06.760
I remember me and Reona did this, too.

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:09.360
You gotta match the colours and the shapes, right?

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:12.270
Here we go... red, blue, yellow.

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:13.630
Mara!

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:16.170
That's right, maroon.

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:19.150
Mara!

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:21.470
"Moron"? Who're you calling a moron?

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.580
Mara!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.260
I ain't no moron, ya brat.

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:36.040
Hm? What's that? Did I make you mad?

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:38.330
You gotta let these things go, my child.

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.710
You're a cranky one, all right.

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.080
Hey, hold on – whoa!

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.730
All right, I'm back to normal!

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:49.880
Julu–

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.280
Jululu!

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:56.270
Hey, I can't get out of here!

00:09:56.270 --> 00:10:00.160
Hey, no, come back! Help me!

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:04.560
Little Jululu! No, lovely Jululu! Princess Jululu!

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:06.400
Hey, where are you going?

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.080
No, <i>come back</i>!

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:11.370
No way...

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:13.550
I'm trapped in here!

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:17.630
Somebody help me!

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:31.230
Mama... Mama...

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:35.320
Ma... Mama!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:44.200
Well, great – now what am I supposed to do?

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:55.630
She loves her special specs – how does that sound?

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.520
...ma! Mama!

00:10:57.520 --> 00:11:02.030
Beary well done, girls. Keep this up, and SoLaMi SMILE will triumph in a hundred battles out of a hundred!

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:03.740
Ha-ha-ha-hundred!

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:04.190
Hm?

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:06.220
Jululu?

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:06.360
What are you doing here?

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:08.910
Mara! Mara!
What are you doing here?

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.680
You want some marmalade?

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:13.070
Mara!

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:14.110
Marrow?

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.440
Mara!

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:18.280
It kind of sounds like she's saying "moron".

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.360
Where's Dorothy?

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.970
She's not with you?

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.620
What's she pri-ing at?

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:24.600
Mara!

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:27.040
Do you think something happened to her?

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.600
Hey, she was trying to get into this, wasn't she?

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:35.080
I bet I can crack this baby right open now.

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:37.500
Much obliged!

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:40.170
I'll take a quick idol lesson while on the hunt for scoops.

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:45.200
Man, this thing does <i>not</i> want to open!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:47.310
It's really stuck... must be busted.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:51.640
If I were at home, I'd just get Reona to do it.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.480
Come on!

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:57.400
All right, that's muscle power for you!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:02.200
I did it, I did it! This is the first good thing to happen since getting stuck in here!

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:05.530
Someone left a compact in a cradle?

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.280
This smells like a scoop to me!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.390
Hey, you! C'mon, help me!

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.520
What're you doing?

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.190
What a shocking twist!

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:21.470
What's with her?

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:25.640
Oh, what a beautiful cloud!

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:27.210
As soft as–

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.060
This cloud is really hard!

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:32.520
It's not a cloud! Don't eat anything you find, Mikan!
This cloud is really hard!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.960
It's not a cloud! Don't eat anything you find, Mikan!

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:39.200
Aroma! This cloud's really hard!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:41.640
Say what? Begone, evil spirit!

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:45.520
Demon, demon, deruderubi!

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.710
Hey, whoa, that's a river there! Stop, please stop!

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:51.700
It stopped...

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:54.460
Dorothy?

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.120
She's gone!

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.310
What's going on?

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.120
Where's Dorothy?

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.090
I wonder where she's gone.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.930
Something's definitely happened-pri.

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.300
Jululu came to get help-pri.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:07.640
What?

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:10.380
I'm exhausted...

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:13.580
I feel like a hundred-year-old granny.

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:18.490
Oh well. I guess I'm gonna have to live here now.

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:21.420
Babies get to sleep all day, anyway.

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:23.280
No homework either.

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:26.990
If Reona were here, it'd be perfect.

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:33.410
Dorothy!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:36.990
Reona! Shion! I'm in here! Come and save me!

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:38.680
Dorothy!

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:42.110
Hey! In here! I'm in here!

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:44.480
Did you hear that?

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:46.060
That was Dorothy's voice!

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:51.010
Reona! Shion! You listening to me?
I'm in here! Come and help me!

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:52.470
What?

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:55.500
What on earth happened, Dorothy?

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:56.440
What are you <i>doing</i>?

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:59.650
Please help me! I'm stuck in here!

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.240
No way!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:04.610
Give her here! Hup! Hup, hup, hup!

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.070
It's not shaking in here at all!

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.310
Dorothy, relax!

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:10.620
As if I could!

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:13.550
Hold up! There is still one option available to us.

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:14.330
What?

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:16.600
We destroy the fenestra.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:17.370
<i>Go</i>!

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:19.320
Shion, wait!

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.760
Gah – it's hard!

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:22.400
Dorothy!

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:25.580
No! Help me!

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:26.350
Ah!

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:27.630
Dorothy!

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:31.130
No!

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:39.130
Jululu!

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:42.280
Did you come and get help for me?

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:46.280
I've never been so happy to see you before...

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.950
And I'm back to fun-size.

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:52.800
Ma! Shi! Mi! Re! Fi!

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.800
So you went to get everyone.

00:14:57.530 --> 00:15:01.020
You're... not a bad kid at all.

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:05.470
But I said nothing but mean things to you... I'm sorry, Jululu.

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:08.040
I bet you didn't understand at all.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:23.320
Oh, yeah, I went and got it out for you.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:26.400
You really like fairy floss, huh?

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:31.230
I guess we're doomed to live here for the next hundred millennia, but let's make the most of it.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:40.080
Hey, we've stopped.

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.040
Moo-moo!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:47.880
Hold up, Jululu! That cow's huge; it could stomp you flat!

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:50.480
Moo-moo!

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:57.470
We got out!

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:00.650
I'm back to normal!

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:03.870
Do I grab this to go in and out?

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:05.100
Dorothy!

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:06.400
Jululu!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.690
Are you all right?

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:09.230
What have you been doing-pri?

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.910
Thanks a bunch, Jululu!

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:12.910
It was pretty fun in the end.

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.770
Let's play together again sometime.

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:19.760
Isn't that right, Jululu?

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:31.630
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:34.380
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.170
Starting the Coord Change.

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:42.720
Shion has a rockin' feel with the deep purple and fluffy tail charm.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:45.690
Violet Crosswalk Coord!

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:46.440
<i>Go</i>!

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:53.360
Dorothy and Reona bring a bouncy feel with the energetic colours and pompom charms.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:56.190
Sky-Blue Crosswalk Coord!

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:57.160
Yay!

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:03.690
The enchanting blend of cool and pop earns this team coord a perfect hundred points!

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:06.100
Scarlet Crosswalk Coord!

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:09.900
Yay!

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.720
Dorothy's back to her full and luscious self!

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.220
What?

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:20.430
Today I'd like to give a hundred million-horsepower shout-out

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:23.180
to the one-in-a-century goddess who helped me out!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.290
A picture is worth a hundred thousand words!

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:29.630
Run for Jumping!

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:46.310
Making Drama, switch on!

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:47.960
<i>Go</i>!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:49.800
Blue skies!

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:51.800
Yay!

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:53.320
The setting sun!

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:55.580
Looking at the twinkling stars,

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:57.070
the three of us together!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.190
Friends forever!

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:03.310
Youth, jumping, snapping!

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:09.750
Cyalume Change!

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.390
<i>Go</i>!

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:17.110
Yay!

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.560
We'll always love you, Dorothy!

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:53.650
Shine your max ray upon us, Dorothy!

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:55.150
You have the voice of an angel!

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:58.170
Surely the goddess will come calling for Dorothy this time.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.540
Mara!

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:04.060
Hey. Did Jululu just call Dorothy a moron?

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:05.260
Beary possible.

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.900
N–No way! Then, you mean...

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:10.850
She won't get the Super Cyalume Coord this time, either...

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:18.480
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:22.060
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:24.800
Yay!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.040
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.950
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:54.060
The closet's doors open for you...

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.440
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:05.550
Yay! Yay! Tension 100 max!

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:07.980
I finally got a Super Cyalume Coord!

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:09.410
That's great, Dorothy!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:09.790
Hundred
out of a
hundred

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:12.160
That was a hundred-out-of-a-hundred performance.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:15.070
You were shining bright, Dorothy.

00:21:15.070 --> 00:21:19.680
And Jululu thought you were wonderful, as well.

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:21.530
That goes without saying!

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:22.710
Isn't that right, Jululu?

00:21:23.600 --> 00:21:25.130
Dora.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:25.880
Eh?

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:28.110
Dora!

00:21:28.110 --> 00:21:30.520
All right! She said it!

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:32.970
You can be a good kid if you try!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:35.960
Well, now.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:43.500
This makes three teams gathered – SoLaMi SMILE, Triangle and Dressing Pafé.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:45.310
Now the one hundredth–

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:49.120
I mean, the first Divine Idol Grand Prix, will be held.

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:53.040
It's finally time!

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.170
Yes.

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:56.330
Dressing Pafé's bringing home gold.

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.170
Pri sure you mean SoLaMi SMILE.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.880
Growth through a hundred battles!

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:01.800
Let us fight and evolve as rivals.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:02.730
Capisce!

00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:09.680
And incidentally, today PriPara broadcast its hundredth episode.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:13.230
In commemoration, allow me to bestow one hundred winks upon you.

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:15.680
100 capisce!

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:16.690
Hum-ra!

00:22:16.690 --> 00:22:17.440
Congratulations

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:19.900
<b>100 Episodes</b>

00:23:50.660 --> 00:23:52.990
It's finally the first Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:55.290
SoLaMi SMILE's gonna capisce our best!

00:23:55.290 --> 00:23:58.240
Fortune smiles upon us – Dressing Pafé will triumph!

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:00.750
Triangle's gonna super take first place!

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:01.620
Kano-pero!

00:24:02.030 --> 00:24:04.920
Next time, <i>It's Here! The Divine Idol Grand Prix!</i>
